            <ArticleTitle>Spine update. Degenerative lumbar spondylolisthesis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1084-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Degenerative lumbar spondylolisthesis associated with spinal stenosis is a common condition of the aging spine. This article presents a detailed description of the pathophysiology, clinical presentation, and nonoperative and operative intervention of this condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
